      "detail": "With a synthetic root explicitly containing apps[2], the entire candidate restrictContext118 still produces a view with apps===undefined. The whole actual install118/createControl functions reach the fixed GRANT expression and throw TypeError before COMMIT. The model rolls back DDL and retains install-intent; no HTTP is dispatched.",
