      },
      "minimumCorrectionBoundary": "Before all-six-mode/FI readiness, reconcile the fixed readonly app-role data required by createControl with the confined view. Do not inject an ordinary ctx, accept arbitrary role/options/callbacks, expand actor permissions or change the fixed GRANT target. Any production fix needs Root authorization and a new sealed candidate; none is implemented by this review."
